@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    Layout = "_Layout";
}
<section class="py-4">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4" style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: July 2026</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly — your name, email address, profile photos, and any details you add to your profile. We also collect usage data such as page visits, likes, and messages to improve our service.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
        <p>We use your data to operate the platform, connect you with other members, send service notifications, and improve our matching algorithms. We never sell your personal data.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Data Sharing</h5>
        <p>Your profile information is visible to other registered members as part of the service. We do not share your data with third parties for their marketing purposes without your explicit consent.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Cookies</h5>
        <p>We use essential cookies for authentication and session management. Optional analytics cookies help us understand how you use the site. You can manage cookie preferences in your browser settings.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">5. Your Rights</h5>
        <p>You can access, update, or delete your personal data at any time from your account settings. To request full data deletion, contact us through the Contact page.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">6. Security</h5>
        <p>We use encryption (HTTPS) for all data transmission and follow industry best practices to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">7. Contact</h5>
        <p>If you have questions about this policy, please <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>
